{
  "name": "Partial refunds for orders",
  "description": "This design lets support refund single order lines rather than whole orders, and retires credit notes.\n\n# Where it lands\n\n- A new refunds module beside orders ([Refund single lines](noesis:need|refund-single-lines)).\n\n# Where to start reading\n\n1. [Refund](noesis:building_block|sales.refunds.Refund) records the lines given back; [Refund.issue](noesis:behavior|sales.refunds.Refund.issue) issues it and publishes [RefundIssued](noesis:building_block|sales.refunds.RefundIssued).\n2. [Order](noesis:building_block|sales.orders.Order) keeps the amount refunded so far, gains a partially refunded status and drops its credit note.\n\n# Around them\n\n- [CreditNote](noesis:building_block|sales.credit-notes.CreditNote) is removed with its issue behavior.",
  "needs": {
    "added": [
      {
        "id": "refund-single-lines",
        "name": {
          "value": "Refund single lines"
        },
        "stakeholder": {
          "value": "Support agents"
        },
        "statement": {
          "value": "Support agents need to refund one line of an order when the customer returns only part of it, without cancelling the whole order."
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "modules": {
    "added": [
      {
        "id": "module|sales.refunds",
        "name": {
          "value": "refunds"
        },
        "definition": {
          "value": "Everything about giving money back to a customer."
        }
      }
    ],
    "removed": ["module|sales.credit-notes"],
    "modified": [
      {
        "id": "module|sales.orders",
        "definition": {
          "value": "Order lifecycle, now including the refundable state of each line.",
          "author": "human"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "module|sales"
      }
    ]
  },
  "buildingBlocks": {
    "added": [
      {
        "id": "building_block|sales.refunds.Refund",
        "name": {
          "value": "Refund",
          "author": "human"
        },
        "type": {
          "value": "aggregate",
          "author": "human"
        },
        "definition": {
          "value": "A refund of one or more lines of a single order."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "building_block|sales.refunds.RefundIssued",
        "name": {
          "value": "RefundIssued"
        },
        "type": {
          "value": "event"
        },
        "definition": {
          "value": "Tells the ledger a refund went out."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "building_block|sales.refunds.RefundRepository",
        "name": {
          "value": "RefundRepository"
        },
        "type": {
          "value": "repository"
        },
        "definition": {
          "value": "Stores refunds."
        }
      }
    ],
    "removed": ["building_block|sales.credit-notes.CreditNote"],
    "modified": [
      {
        "id": "building_block|sales.orders.Order"
      }
    ]
  },
  "behaviors": {
    "added": [
      {
        "id": "behavior|sales.refunds.Refund.issue",
        "name": {
          "value": "issue"
        },
        "definition": {
          "value": "Issues a refund for the chosen lines of an order."
        },
        "diagram": {
          "value": "sequenceDiagram\n  Support agent->>Refund: issue(orderId, lines)\n  Refund->>RefundRepository: save(refund)\n  Refund-->>Support agent: RefundIssued"
        }
      }
    ],
    "removed": ["behavior|sales.credit-notes.CreditNote.issue"],
    "modified": []
  },
  "rules": {
    "added": [
      {
        "id": "rule|sales.refunds.Refund never exceeds paid amount",
        "name": {
          "value": "Refund never exceeds paid amount"
        },
        "kind": {
          "value": "validation"
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "The sum of all refunds of an order is at most what the customer paid for it.",
          "author": "human"
        },
        "needs": {
          "value": ["refund-single-lines"]
        },
        "rationale": {
          "value": "Support may never pay out more than the order brought in."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "rule|sales.refunds.Only paid orders are refundable",
        "name": {
          "value": "Only paid orders are refundable"
        },
        "kind": {
          "value": "state_change"
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "An unpaid order has nothing to refund."
        },
        "needs": {
          "value": []
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "scenarios": {
    "added": [
      {
        "id": "scenario|sales.refunds.Refund never exceeds paid amount.Refunding one line of a paid order",
        "name": {
          "value": "Refunding one line of a paid order"
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "The happy path of a partial refund."
        },
        "steps": {
          "value": [
            {
              "kind": "given",
              "text": "a paid order with two lines"
            },
            {
              "kind": "when",
              "text": "support refunds the first line"
            },
            {
              "kind": "then",
              "text": "a refund for that line's amount is issued and the second line stays refundable"
            }
          ],
          "author": "agent"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "actors": {
    "added": [
      {
        "id": "actor|Support agent",
        "name": {
          "value": "Support agent"
        },
        "definition": {
          "value": "Answers customers by phone and email, and refunds what they return.",
